ed to different projects under guidance of experienced mentors.</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Software Engineering Intern","company":"Novopay","location":null,"range":"November 2020 - Present","url":"https://www.novopay.in/"},"html":"<ul>\n<li>Worked to build Credit Rating Engine from the scratch for the customers who have taken loan</li>\n<li>Revived a AI/ML Workbench that has been closed 3 years back</li>\n<li>Supported the data team for crunching and analysis purpose</li>\n<li>Added various UI/UX features in Oxygen4India website</li>\n<li>Worked on Invoices OCR Detection Model.</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Web Developer Intern","company":"Pradivya Software Private Limited","location":null,"range":"August 2020 - October 2020 ","url":"http://www.workerunionsupport.com/"},"html":"<ul>\n<li>Created UI/UX for grey and white collar workers to access GIS information.</li>\n<li>Added Server application to process the images from Bhuvan for Garbage Management, Road crack/problem, and Broken water pipeline.</li>\n<li>View <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QKyJbp7qj5ffgBLKWH-VvfJWWeyc0edy/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">letter</a></li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Runner-Up","company":"IBM Hack","location":null,"range":"May 2020 - July 2020","url":"https://smartinternz.com/ibm-hack-challenge-2020"},"html":"<ul>\n<li>Designed a twitter sentiment analysis model to understand the people’s sentiment towards the epidemic and on the government decision to extend the lockdown.</li>\n<li>View <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1doiZh2yVgevKgj0CVfyOE31kLFaGe3fY/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Certificate</a></li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Software Development Intern","company":"VoiceMail","location":null,"range":"July 2020 - August 2020","url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1fDjf-hfUytfB1ugpymhnpqR73waY_ROz/view?usp=sharing"},"html":"<ul>\n<li>I got the chance to work on a product for those people who want to express themselves using Audio Platform.</li>\n<li>Worked on User Interface by understanding the design briefs, and on Matlab to design a piece of code that would help to convert a male voice to female, child and robotic voice and vice versa.</li>\n<li>View <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1fDjf-hfUytfB1ugpymhnpqR73waY_ROz/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">CERTIFICATE</a></li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Runber-Uo","company":"SIH 2020","location":null,"range":"Feb 2020 - April 2020","url":"https://www.sih.gov.in/sih2020PS/NA==/U29mdHdhcmU=/RGVwYXJ0bWVudCBvZiBBdG9taWMgRW5lcmd5/QWxs"},"html":"<ul>\n<li>Drafted all the website content for the startup.</li>\n<li>Managed the LinkedIn advertisements and sponsor proposals.</li>\n<li>View <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1YSHuAa3RM5CrlqFe9zvD6w9EBezPhAri/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">CERTIFICATE</a></li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Software Development Intern","company":"IIIT Allahabad","location":null,"range":"April 2019 - August 2019","url":"https://www.iiita.ac.in/"},"html":"<ul>\n<li>Utilized source code control for tracking configurations and changes to convert a dusk image to dawn image and vice versa, using the concept of pix2pi(Predict pixels to pixels)</li>\n<li>Used structure of Conditional Generative Adversarial Network, to train the designed network using PyTorch and processing in real-time.</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Core Member","company":"Enigma","location":null,"range":"Jan 2018 - Dec 2019","url":""},"html":"<ul>\n<li>Core Member of IIIT Pune Robotics Team</li>\n<li>Had been an instructor in the Robotics Club of my college</li>\n<li>Used to teach my juniors the concepts of Robotics, use of Python, and Arduino, and also to use them to relate wuth real-life use-cases.</li>\n</ul>"}}]},"featured":{"edges":[{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Face Recognition System","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"fluid":{"tracedSVG":"data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='400'%20height='225'%20viewBox='0%200%20400%20225'%20preserveAspectRatio='none'%3e%3cpath%20d='M18%2011v10H0v10c0%2010%200%2011%202%2010%202%200%205%202%204%203H0v20l1%2020%204-2%205-4%205-2c3%200%203%200%201%201-4%200-6%204-4%208v4c-1%201-1%200-2-2v-4l-4%202c-5%201-7%203-5%203l1%203-1%202-1%2046v47h66l-1%203%201%204%202%204c0%202%200%202-4%202s-4%200-1-1l3-1c0-2-8-2-17%200l-9%202h10a2140%202140%200%2000-45%205l-5%201v20h158a4874%204874%200%2000211-1l32%201-1-19-1-19c-2%200-1-2%201-2l1-42a239%20239%200%2000-2-42v3l1%208v8l-7%203c-3%202-8%203-10%203-3%200-4%201-6%208l-3%207h22l-6-1c-9-2-10-2-8-3h6l7%201h5v4c0%205%201%205-15%202l-12-2-6%2018%2014%203%2011%204c-1%202-8%201-12-1-9-4-23-2-31%204-3%202-5%202-17%204a223%20223%200%2000-18%201l-4%202a29%2029%200%2001-45-7l-2-2%203%207%204%205h-6c-5%201-7%201-12-1l-6-2c-1%201-2%200-3-2-2-3-2-3%200-4s-3-3-6-3l-3%201v-7l1-8h-4c-4%200-4%200-4-2l1-4%203-1h4l-3-1c-3-1-4%200-9%204-7%205-9%205-9%201v-6l-2-3h5l10%202c6%200%208%201%208%203%200%201%204%201%208-2h4l1-1%201-1c1%201%203%200%205-2%204-4%206-3%204%202-2%203-2%203%201%204%203%202%204%201%206-3%205-10%2016-16%2034-16%203%200%2014%2011%2017%2017%202%203%204%205%206%205%201%200%204-10%204-15%200-4%200-4%201-2s1%202%202%201l1-2v2l1-1c3-6%203-8%202-8h-1c0-2%203-4%206-4l6-1h3l-1-7c0-8-1-8-7-8-4%200-5%200-5%202l-1%203-4%202c-3%203-3%203-3%201s-1-2-4%200c-3%201-3%201-1%203%201%202%201%202-2%202l-3%201h3c3%200%203%200%203%203v3h-10c-11%201-21%200-23-3-1-1%200-1%209-1l11-1c0-1-11-2-16-1s-5%202-11-6a265%20265%200%2000-8-11c-3-4-10-10-10-8-1%202%200%2016%201%2022%200%205-1%205-2%201l-3-8c-2-7-4-19-2-14l2%202c0-1-2-12-3-11-2%200-11-3-12-5-1-1-2-2-3-1-3%200-5-3-5-11-1-7%201-12%203-12v-1l2-2%203-3s1-2%203-2c4-2%204-3%200-6-4-2-11-2-17%202l-4%203-3%201c-3%201-3%201-2%205l-1%